{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026IGWXqQskte1792638756.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>港股中午前沽壓增加，跌幅有所擴大。</p><p></p><p>科網股普遍向下，騰訊跌百分之1。京東公布業績後，股價急挫百分之7。金融股也受壓，滙控跌下試135元水平，友邦也跌百分之1。</p><p></p><p>石油股逆市造好，新奧能源升百分之4。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:06:32.148315+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T05:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T22:17:33.436837+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T05:59:52.912734+00:00","content_hash":"34e6b1ecbf95968ece900d6c969bbe71c32a4affb7f99f2a2c81c4b6f88a49e1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:06:32.148315+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}